    31	      url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Principles_of_Mathematical_Analysis"
    32	    - title: "R. Gardner, Introduction to Topology, notes on Munkres Section 20: The Metric Topology (East Tennessee State University)"
    33	      url: "https://faculty.etsu.edu/gardnerr/5357/notes/Munkres-20.pdf"
